{'symbol': 'PKI', 'date': '2022-02-01 16:05:00', 'title': 'PERKINELMER ANNOUNCES FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR OF 2021', 'text': 'WALTHAM, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PERKINELMER, INC. (NYSE: PKI), A GLOBAL LEADER COMMITTED TO INNOVATING FOR A HEALTHIER WORLD, TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR ENDED JANUARY 2, 2022. FOURTH QUARTER 2021 THE COMPANY REPORTED GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS OF $1.41, AS COMPARED TO GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS OF $3.38 IN THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2020. GAAP REVENUE FOR THE QUARTER WAS $1.36 BILLION, AS COMPARED TO $1.35 BI'}